<title>BELGIUM: Lernout &amp; Hauspie pays $15.5 cash mln for Berkeley.</title>
<headline>Lernout &amp; Hauspie pays $15.5 cash mln for Berkeley.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Lernout &amp; Hauspie Speech Products said on Tuesday it had paid $15.5 million in cash for Berkeley Speech Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>It said the purchase would create the conditions for L&amp;H to become one of the key players in the speech-to-text market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
